        "content_section_GLa7AN": {
          "type": "content_section",
          "settings": {
            "nav_label": "Our commitment",
            "title": "1. Our commitment to trust and transparency",
            "lead": "<p>Your rights come from the law, not from our goodwill. This page sets them out in one place, alongside the promises Karmicare adds on top.</p>",
            "content": "<p>At KARMICARE, we believe in radical transparency, both in the biological formulations we craft and in the commercial relationships we build with our community. This charter summarises your statutory rights under:</p><ul><li>The Belgian Code of Economic Law (WER/CDE), notably Book VI on market practices and consumer protection;</li><li>The EU Consumer Rights Directive (2011/83/EU);</li><li>The EU Omnibus Directive (2019/2161) on modernised consumer protection rules;</li><li>The EU Sale of Goods Directive (2019/771), transposed into Belgian law by the Law of 20 March 2022;</li><li>The EU Cosmetics Regulation (EC) No 1223/2009.</li></ul><p>Whether you order a single Duo or keep a plan running, your legal rights are fully protected.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_section_g6nYeY": {
          "type": "content_section",
          "settings": {
            "nav_label": "Safety and standards",
            "title": "2. Safety and standards",
            "lead": "<p>Awake and Asleep are notified EU cosmetics, made under Good Manufacturing Practice and assessed by a qualified safety assessor.</p>",
            "content": "<p>All KARMICARE products, including Awake Morning Toothpaste, Asleep Evening Toothpaste, Charcoal Floss and the Toothbrushes, are:</p><ul><li>Formulated and manufactured in accordance with European Good Manufacturing Practices (GMP / ISO 22716);</li><li>Registered and notified on the European Cosmetic Product Notification Portal (CPNP) in compliance with Regulation (EC) No 1223/2009;</li><li>Subject to a Cosmetic Product Safety Report (CPSR) signed by a qualified European safety assessor;</li><li>100% free of SLS, parabens, artificial dyes, endocrine disruptors and controversial abrasives.</li></ul><p>Regulatory classification: KARMICARE oral care products are cosmetics intended for daily oral hygiene, biorhythmic remineralisation and enamel support. They are not medicinal products or medical devices and do not claim to diagnose, treat or cure medical conditions.</p>"
          }
        },
